User: $\Delta ABC$ is isosceles with $AC = BC$. If $m\angle C = 40^{\circ}$, what is the number of degrees in $m\angle CBD$? [asy] pair A,B,C,D,E;
C = dir(65); B = C + dir(-65); D = (1.5,0); E = (2,0);
draw(B--C--A--E); dot(D);
