\[\overrightarrow{CH} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 + 3t \\ 2 + 2t \\ 3 + t \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix} 3 \\ 4 \\ 5 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -2 + 3t \\ -2 + 2t \\ -2 + t \end{pmatrix}.\]This vector will be orthogonal to $\overrightarrow{BA},$ so
